  const JOURNAL = ['Tallyport. Odalys has my letter, for whoever comes out of the sea next. I waited forty years for the next one. I can’t wait any longer.', 'Brackwater. The council has been striking rows out of the Ledger. Not many. Mostly people who asked questions they didn’t like.', 'Haverly. The council counts its masters every year. The count has been wrong twice, and I know whose rows went missing.', 'Four Fords. Two tables that should match, and don’t. Someone took lines out from between them, and the clerk who did it left his name.', 'Cinderwick. Ysolt Karn made me a pen that can write a struck row back in. I tried it on one line. It works.', 'Kell. The Lich keeps the deepest vault. It told me a row is never really gone, only hidden. I hid mine forty years ago.', 'Highwatch. You can see the Brass Sea from the tower on a clear day. I watched for the light every spring for forty years.', 'Aldermoot. I’ve written back every row the council struck, except mine. Whoever has my letter: I’m in the archive under Aldermoot.'];
