    c506: '"Subtract one date from another. Who took more than sixty days to pay?"', c507: '"Turn rows into columns. One row per factor: shipped, open and cancelled, side by side."', c508: '"Sort every open invoice into buckets by how old it is. Every counting house runs this one."', c509: '"Compare the promised date with the delivery date. Which vendors deliver on time?"', c510: '"Divide safely, so you never divide by zero. What share of each category is running low?"',
