  const TALK = {
    m: [['"So you’re the one the Marigold pulled out of the sea. Odalys Brine, First Circle. Your sword arm won’t help you here: everything that takes skill runs on SQL. Sit down and I’ll teach you the first part."', '"Back for more? Wex Carrow’s harbor books are a mess. Sort a few and he’ll pay you."', '"Not yet. Do a couple more exercises here, then go north."', '"You’ve got everything I teach. Go north to Brackwater. Ilse Fenn will find every hole in it."'],
      ['"You’re Tallyport’s new champion. Word got here before you did. I’m Ilse Fenn. Odalys taught you to ask for everything. I teach WHERE, so you only get the rows you want."', '"Back already? Good. I’ve got another one for you."', '"Keep going. You’re not done with WHERE yet."', '"That’s all of WHERE. Go on to Haverly. Maud Tallow teaches counting."'],
      ['"Maud Tallow, Third Circle. I heard Tallyport found itself a champion in the sea. Up here we don’t read rows, we total them: COUNT, SUM, AVG and GROUP BY."', '"You again. Sit. I’ve got a stack that needs adding up."', '"Another one. Totals are only useful if they’re right."', '"Nothing left to count with me. Tobin Ash at Four Fords teaches joins. He talks a lot. Let him."'],
      ['"Tobin Ash. You’d be Tallyport’s stranger, then. One table has the order, another has the customer’s name. JOIN puts them side by side. That’s the Fourth Circle."', '"There’s the champion. Come in off the road. I’ve got two tables that need joining."', '"Watch your join conditions on this one. Get them wrong and every row counts twice."', '"You can join anything to anything now. Brannoch Reeve in Cinderwick is next. Wear thick boots."'],
      ['"Brannoch Reeve. Stand back from the sparks. Raw values are no use to anyone. The Fifth Circle is CASE, COALESCE, text and dates: turning them into something people can read."', '"You’re back. Pick up the tongs, I’ve got work."', '"Another one off the pile. Mind the dates, they’re the tricky part."', '"I’ve nothing left to teach you. Nym Sable in Kell does queries inside queries. Mind your head on the ceiling."'],
      ['"Keep your voice down, the crystal carries sound. I’m Nym Sable. Down here a query can hold another query: subqueries, EXISTS and CTEs. The inner one runs first."', '"You came back down. Sit where the light’s good."', '"One more. Write the inner query first and check it on its own."', '"That’s all I have. Climb to Highwatch. Maren Holt teaches window functions."'],
      ['"Maren Holt. Breathe slowly, the air’s thin. Window functions let each row see its neighbors: the one before it, its rank, the running total. Most people give up here. Don’t."', '"The stairs didn’t stop you. Good. Sit down."', '"Another one. Say what you’re ranking over before you rank it."', '"You can see as far as I can now. Aldermoot is a day west. Bryn Okoro teaches you to write."'],
      ['"Bryn Okoro. Wipe your hands. Everything so far was reading. The Eighth Circle writes: INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE. A row you change is changed for everyone."', '"Back at the desk. Check every line before you run it."', '"Another one. Read it twice before you commit it."', '"There is no ninth circle. There’s the council’s Audit, and whatever you do with what you’ve learned."']],
    s: [['"Pim Underhill. I’m a student here, three years now. Odalys lets me set the practice questions. Want one?"', '"Wex Carrow, harbormaster. I spend all day looking up ships. Help me with a few and I’ll pay you."'],
      ['"Hob Sedge. I failed the Second Circle twice, so I know every way to get WHERE wrong. Want to try one of mine?"', '"Tam Osk, reedwarden. I count herons and cut reeds. I’ve got a few lookups if you’ve got a minute."'],
      ['"Abbot Fenwright. The chapel keeps its own small ledger and I can never get the totals to agree. Would you look?"', '"Tessaly Roe. Three hundred sheep. I can total them faster than Maud. Want to see how?"'],
      ['"Corwin Dale. I’m meant to be studying. I’ve got a few joins I can’t crack, if you want a go."', '"Bly Hobb, wagonmaster. Every wagon through here is a line in somebody’s book. I like to know whose."'],
      ['"Ysolt Karn, forgemistress. I’ve got records that need cleaning before I can use them. Practice on those."', '"Sefa Lund. I came to learn the forge and they gave me a ledger. Want to share the work?"'],
      ['"Orrin Dusk. I cut crystal. One wrong tap and it shatters, same as a bad subquery. I’ve got a few to try."', '"Marrow Pike, deacon of the deep chapel. I keep the chapel’s books. They need a careful hand."'],
      ['"Calla Vane. I keep the tower’s records. Mostly weather, some rankings. Sit, I’ll show you one."', '"Hale Verity. I’m new. They gave me the cold room and the hard exercises. Help me with some?"'],
      ['"Lune Farrow. I’ve copied the same page for a year so I stop blotting. I’ve got some practice for you."', '"Petra Voss, archivist. Everything written ends up on my shelves. Help me keep it in order."']],
    again: ['"Back again. I kept one for you."', '"There you are. I’ve got another."', '"Sit down. It’s ready when you are."'],
    praise: ['"That’s right. I’d have written the same."', '"Correct. Next one."', '"Good. Exactly what was asked, nothing extra."', '"Right. Do a few more until it’s easy."', '"Tidy. Don’t tell the others I said so."', '"Right again. You’re getting the hang of it."'],
    lead: [['"Wex needs this for the harbor."', '"Quick one."', '"Ilva made me do this one a hundred times."', '"Short query. Get it exactly right."'], ['"Only the rows that match."', '"Most of this table isn’t what you want."', '"Careful, there’s a NULL in this one."', '"Say which rows to keep."'],
      ['"I want the total, not the rows."', '"Nobody on the council reads a thousand lines. Give them one number."', '"Count it twice before you hand it in."', '"Group first, then total."'], ['"Two tables, one answer. Join them."', '"The name is in the other table."', '"Mind the join. Get it wrong and you count everything twice."', '"I want the ones with no match."'],
      ['"Turn these into labels."', '"These numbers need cleaning before anyone can use them."', '"Watch the empty values."', '"Get the dates into a form people can read."'], ['"Answer the inner question first."', '"One query inside another."', '"Run the inner part on its own first."', '"EXISTS is your friend here."'],
      ['"Each row needs to see the ones around it."', '"Rank them."', '"Running totals, in order."', '"Compare each row to the one before."'], ['"Copy first, then change."', '"Read it once more before you run it."', '"Every change is for good. Check the WHERE."', '"Ilva would have checked this three times."']],
    place: ['"Tallyport. Fish is cheap and everyone knows your business. Gulls on the shore, rats on the rocks, and a purple thing in the thicket that takes chickens."', '"Brackwater is half water. Stay on the boards in town. Outside, the pools belong to the toads and the leeches."', '"Haverly is all sky and grass. Hawks nest in the heights to the north. Don’t let a slug sit on your boot."', '"Four Fords feeds half the land. Keep to the road in daylight. Wolves and bandits both work the edges."', '"Cinderwick never cools. Walk on the dark rock, never the bright. The spiders build webs over the vents and they’ll come at you."', '"Kell lights itself. The ghouls up in the heights hunt by sound, so walk quietly out there."', '"Highwatch is the highest town there is. Harpies nest in the crags, and they dive at anyone on the paths."', '"Aldermoot is all marble and quiet voices. Even the creatures out here are made of paper and ink."'],
    tav: ['"You’re the one from the sea! First bowl’s the usual price, sorry. Sit down."', '"Mind the step, it floats. What’ll it be?"', '"Mutton or mutton. What’ll it be?"', '"Every road ends up here eventually. Hungry?"', '"It’s warm in here. It’s warm everywhere. Drink?"', '"Keep your voice down. What can I get you?"', '"Shut the door, you’re letting the mountain in. Soup?"', '"No ink on the tables, please. What’ll it be?"'],
    heal: ['"Sit down. Let me look at you."', '"Who did that to you? Never mind. Hold still."', '"You’re bleeding. Come here."'], stall: ['"Have a look. Looking’s free."', '"Everything on the table’s for sale. So’s the table."', '"Buying or selling? Either suits me."'], way: ['"Long road. Sit by the fire and see what I’ve got."', '"I trade with everyone on this road. Have a look."', '"You look like you’ve run out of something."'],
    rival: ['"Dregan Vosk, Ironwake’s champion. Tallyport lost its champion and went fishing for a new one. Let’s see if they caught anything."', '"Sister Calloway, for the Reedbinder Order. I mean to reach Aldermoot first, slowly. A wager while we wait?"', '"Pell Marrow. Fourth time at these Trials. The candidates keep getting younger. Duel an old man?"', '"Jessamy Crane. I collect most of the tolls on the Longroad. Yours is one question. Ready?"', '"Ilgrave, for Cinderwick. Everything bends if you hit it right. Let’s find out where you bend."', '"I don’t give my name down here. Answer my question and I might ask an easier one."', '"Lady Oriel Vant. Six marks. You’ve heard of me, I’m sure. Duel?"', '"Hale Quarto, for the Chancery. The council sits tomorrow and I don’t want to share the bench. Shall we settle it now?"'],
    bark: ['"Fair weather for the road."', '"My knees say rain."', '"Heading north?"', '"If you see a goat, it isn’t mine. I owe a man a goat."', '"Bread was better last year."', '"Do you know what they charge for candles now?"', '"My cousin took the Trials. He counts beans in Haverly now. Happy as anything."', '"Don’t feed the gulls."', '"Mind how you go."', '"Somebody ought to fix that lamp."', '"I only ever learned SELECT. Enough to count my change."', '"Is it true you came out of the sea?"'],
    hint: ['"There’s a campfire partway along most long roads. You can rest at one."', '"Old chests turn up in the wilds, far from any path. Somebody keeps refilling them."', '"Each master sells the pages for their own circle. The rare ones you have to find."', '"A creature from up north shrugs off a first-circle page. Bring a better one."', '"If you fall in a fight, you wake at the healer’s, and whatever you were carrying stays where you fell. Go back for it quickly."', '"Every creature keeps to its own ground. Your map names them."', '"Hunt a rabbit and you eat tonight. Meat heals you on the road."', '"The examiner stands in a ring of stones on the road out of town."', '"A woman came through in spring and nailed a page to a signpost off the road. Odd thing to do."', '"The bankers hold your gold and gear. Anything in the bank is safe if you fall."'],
    marked: ['"Is that an examiner’s mark? Well, well."', '"They say Tallyport’s champion is collecting marks. That’s you?"', '"My daughter wants to be a champion now. I blame you."'] };

